29:["$","p",null,{"children":"Every page is exactly one of four kinds, and the kind determines the shape.\nMixing two is the most common structural review comment, because a tutorial\nthat pauses to explain tradeoffs stops being a guaranteed happy path, and an\nexplanation that turns into a procedure stops being readable out of order."}]
