47:["$","p",null,{"children":"Fumadocs derives a heading's id from its text. That is convenient and it is\nexactly the problem: the id is a function of the prose, so rewording a\nheading silently repoints every link that cited it. A human notices a dead\nin-page link and scrolls. An agent follows the cached URL, lands at the top\nof the page, and quotes whatever is there."}]
